WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.030
- [Narrator] Your business is wasting time

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.400
and money performing
routine repetitive tasks

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.700
that could easily be automated

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.000
to increase speed and efficiency.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.810
Robotic Process Automation
was made for this.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.360
It's a low risk tool that
speeds up routine tasks

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.390
freeing your employees
to do higher value work.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.360
RPA has many advantages
but it can't automate

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.690
entire business processes
or workflows on its own.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:23.690
For instance,

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.280
what happens when a person
needs to be involved?

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.000
Standalone RPA can't automate
complex processes end to end

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.820
because humans and bots
aren't working together.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.130
What happens if you need
to change business rules

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.410
on the fly, with only RPA,

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:40.300
rule changes often require
an expensive redeployment

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.560
that could take weeks,

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.680
and even though RPA makes
copying and pasting data faster

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.654
and eliminates human error,

00:00:47.654 --> 00:00:50.550
what happens when it
encounters unstructured data

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.940
and can't organize and store captured data

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.610
so your users can find it?

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:57.760
RPA alone is no substitute
for a purpose built

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.800
fully automated process,

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.660
but when RPA integrates with
other automation software

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.950
it's much more effective.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.980
IBM RPA with Automation
Anywhere is bundled

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.480
with Digital Business Automation Express,

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.650
a set of digital business automation tools

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:14.750
that give you the extra
capabilities you need

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.970
when RPA alone isn't getting the job done.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.090
Like workflow capabilities,
that helps humans and automation

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.059
coordinate to run complex
processes from start to finish.

00:01:25.059 --> 00:01:28.170
Operational decision
management capabilities

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.700
that give you the agility
to change rules on the fly

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:32.063
with no downtime.

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.820
Automated capture capabilities,

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:38.527
they can understand any source
including unstructured data,

00:01:38.527 --> 00:01:41.980
and intelligent content
management capabilities

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:45.780
that help users and bots
locate and access data faster.

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:47.300
Get everything you're looking for

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.440
in a Robotic Process
Automation solution plus

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.900
the additional automation
capabilities you need

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:55.620
to unlock greater value from RPA.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.730
IBM Robotic Process Automation
with Automation Anywhere.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:01.123
Learn more today.

